Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.36,0:01:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's gonna be hell to be!
Dialogue: 3,0:01:56.89,0:02:00.85,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE5E6E6&\blur0.6\fad(477,0)}Declaration of War
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.89,0:02:00.85,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&H010101&\3c&H010101&\1a&HFF&\blur0.6\fad(477,0)\t(436,477,\1a&H00&)}Declaration of War
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.52,0:02:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.06,0:02:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Vice Admiral Saul!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ran away with Nico Olvia\Nand now he's attacking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's lost his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.72,0:02:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing on Oma?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.24,0:02:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole island is done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're gonna burn it to the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.74,0:02:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if the library burns,\Nwe can still save the books!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.80,0:02:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw them out the window\Nand drop them in the lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're better off wet than burn to ash!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.10,0:02:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.06,0:02:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back! Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:53.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get all the books out of the library!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.92,0:02:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on a single book!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.74,0:02:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up on a single sentence!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words have been passed\Non for thousands of years!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must reach the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get the heck out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evacuation ship's\Ngonna leave without you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me. Just run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.54,0:03:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.62,0:03:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.06,0:03:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! Go! Get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what your mom told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must live, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.64,0:04:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attention evacuees!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ship is leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.28,0:04:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.62,0:04:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.96,0:04:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the monster?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.30,0:04:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go away, you're creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now's not the time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.82,0:04:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now wait, that kid's mother Ovia was\Nin the newspaper just the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means she's the\Ndaughter of a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.22,0:04:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, if we let her on the\Nship it might cause us trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.14,0:04:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous, she's just\Na child, hurry up and help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:41.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone stop, don't\Nlet that brat on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.64,0:04:45.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may be a child, but\Nshe's still an archaeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means she's a criminal\Nlike the rest of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.86,0:04:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little girl like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you say so, Chief. See? I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good thing we didn't let her on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.00,0:04:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be CP9. Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.26,0:04:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll show them. Chief!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Saul is coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.32,0:05:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then there was no need to question\NOlvia about him after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire! Now! Shoot him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.32,0:05:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice block!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Partisan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kuzan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.64,0:05:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:31.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, my, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just won't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we let a former Marine stop the\NBuster Call, we'd look like damn fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuzan, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.02,0:05:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me this\Nnonsense is justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know this ain't right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.16,0:05:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just making an\Nexample out of Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.92,0:05:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're better than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's for the good of the\Nworld, it has to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.60,0:06:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't deny that those scholars\Nare breaking the law, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.48,0:06:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't criticize your sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are as many rights and wrongs\Nas there are viewpoints in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.00,0:06:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if you insist on getting in our\Nway, I can't sit back and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evacuation ship was blown up. What\Nhappened looks like cannon fire from
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:28.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of our ships it Was vice admiral
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sakazuki that idiot if we're doing this
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.96,0:06:36.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(425,222)\fscx150\fscy150\bord2.5\b600\c&H0E0E11&\3c&H0E0E11&\4c&H0E0E11&\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\fad(476,0)\t(434,476,\1a&H00&)}Vice Admiral Sakazuki\NMarine Headquarters\N(Later to Become\NAdmiral Akainu)
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.96,0:06:36.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(425,222)\fscx150\fscy150\b600\bord0\c&HFFFEFF&\blur0.8\fad(476,0)}Vice Admiral Sakazuki\N{\c&HE6E6E6&}Marine Headquarters\N(Later to Become\NAdmiral Akainu)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we have to be thorough if even one Of\Nthose scholars had managed to sneak on
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,board that ship then all the sacrifices\Nwe made today They would be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.94,0:06:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However small, we cannot\Nallow any evil to thrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what you call justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you take pride in something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:52.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We went too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.52,0:06:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would never do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.58,0:06:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta run, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fellow's way too\Nstrong for me to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sol is escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taking one of the scholars with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.36,0:07:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice time, capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.59,0:07:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sol, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.70,0:07:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, you gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't look back. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.90,0:07:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you stay on this island, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take my raft and go out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:31.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.40,0:07:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got me, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.44,0:07:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.50,0:07:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody I care about is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.02,0:07:47.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may be lonely at first, but\None day you'll find true friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.02,0:07:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.18,0:07:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, the sea's a vast\Nplace, so I guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll find friends\Nwho won't ever leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.42,0:08:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter who you are, ain't no one\Nborn into this world will be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.20,0:08:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.16,0:08:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When things are bad, do like I taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You remember the laugh, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.95,0:08:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.96,0:08:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, ice time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends are out there at\Nsea waiting for you, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you gotta do is find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Share your life with them\Nand never let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.98,0:08:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So this is the history\Nthat mankind has chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.30,0:09:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we ever learn the error of our ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin, I couldn't even leave\Nyou with any parting words,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,neither as a scholar or a mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tree of knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.96,0:09:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:31.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The concept of absolute justice can\Nsometimes drive a man to madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.28,0:09:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to let you escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious to see what\Nkind of flower will
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sprout from the seed that's all protected?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.94,0:09:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can bear a grudge against\Nwhoever you like for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.64,0:09:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least you're still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I do suggest\Nyou keep a low profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.16,0:09:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've drawn a path for\Nyou on the sea with my
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ice if you take the boat\Nand go straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.74,0:09:56.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll reach land eventually oh
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last thing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.02,0:10:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not your ally
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you do cause any trouble, I'll be\Nthe first person to come after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you help her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.70,0:10:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.52,0:10:16.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that pain is too great for you\Nto bear, then you may join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.18,0:10:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This library is the best in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You like to read books?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is Robin's birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.36,0:10:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday from us at the library!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.32,0:10:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your mama's a wonderful woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's a wonderful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.36,0:10:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as surely as we believe in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.72,0:10:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we believe in the future\Nthat you will inherit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.52,0:10:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you're feeling down, just laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.68,0:10:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There ain't nothing a\Ngood laugh can't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.18,0:10:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems awfully silly\Nto laugh when you're sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't knock it till you try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dad, she, she, she, she,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea's a fast place, so I guarantee
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.54,0:11:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.45,0:11:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll find friends\Nwho won't ever leave you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Survivors?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.40,0:11:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.97,0:11:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:55.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did all those books get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.86,0:12:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's definitely the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.16,0:12:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did you find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she captured? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were told to keep watch\Nfor a suspicious girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We eventually found her on a\Npassenger ship northeast of Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.74,0:12:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, she knew\Nwhat we were after,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.62,0:12:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so she slipped away\Nbefore we could catch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.40,0:12:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, she's got the devil's luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.50,0:12:28.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back then, I'm sure I\Nsaw her leaving Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The island was burning to ash,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she somehow made it out\Nalone on a little rowboat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, i tried to chase\Nher, but all of a sudden,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the helm of our boat got stuck\Nlike it was frozen in ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sol probably helped her\Nescape before he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A scholar with the ability\Nto read the poneglyphs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is dangerous no matter\Nhow young she may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.38,0:12:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.96,0:12:51.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what methods you use.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.24,0:12:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't capture her immediately,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.26,0:12:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then this entire mission\Nwill have been for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.78,0:13:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seventy-nine million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.86,0:13:05.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does an eight-year-old\Nchild have such a high bounty?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:07.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said she's one of\Nthe devils of Ohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.80,0:13:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, those scholars who\Nare plotting to end the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.54,0:13:11.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard she's saying six\Nmarine battleships, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must have some kind of weird power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.84,0:13:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that explains the bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.76,0:13:22.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The government forces and Navy\Nleaders are searching for her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She probably wants to carry out the same\Nplan as the scholars that were executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.38,0:13:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she's out for revenge,\Nthen no one is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let a child\Nof the devil run wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.78,0:13:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a kind girl, thank\Nyou for helping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'm grateful for any work I can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, before we have our\Ndinner, some men are here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.62,0:13:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, give me my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.36,0:13:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you where she was hiding, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.66,0:13:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may be small, but\Nshe still works hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:13:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.96,0:13:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having trouble sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.26,0:14:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to get up early tomorrow\Nto go to work, so rest well. Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's sweet, but if we keep her around,\Nwe could get in serious trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.32,0:14:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, just look at this bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.54,0:14:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She isn't in her room! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She must have overheard us talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.34,0:14:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're hungry. Sorry, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seems we're both wanted by\Nthe law robin i know all about
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.80,0:14:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you work for me and i'll\Nmake sure you never go hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.74,0:14:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,captain the marines are after us where did\Nrobin go Hand her over, dammit! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.14,0:14:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl is bad luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A devil like you shouldn't even exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:14:58.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.07,0:15:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robbins here? Where at?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.90,0:15:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunt her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.04,0:15:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn her into the government!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.74,0:15:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A Poneglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to sell\Nto the likes of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.32,0:15:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please just allow me to join your group.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.18,0:15:22.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You betrayed me, you damn witch!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin, I'd like you to assist me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.44,0:15:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been told you can read Poneglyphs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you trigger a Buster Call,\Neverything will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.48,0:15:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That includes all of Eni's lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.36,0:15:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And most likely, you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.92,0:15:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't kill a VIP like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.88,0:15:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not falling for your bluff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:16:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Twenty years ago, everything\Nwas taken from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And many innocent lives were lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With one push of a button,\NI summoned a terrible demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it rears its head again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.40,0:16:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,aiming its sights on the friends\NI've searched so hard to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:18.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more that I wish\Nfor us to be together,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the more my ugly fate\Nbears its fangs at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even now, no matter how far we sail, there's\Nan enemy that haunts me at every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.66,0:16:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm facing the world\Nand all of its darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First it was Aokiji, and now CP9.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.58,0:16:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've dragged you into my\Ntroubles twice already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it goes on and on like this,\Nno matter how kind you may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll see me as a burden!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll be forced to\Nbetray me and throw me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.92,0:16:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm most\Nafraid of! Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I didn't want you to rescue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:17:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's the only future I have,\NI'd rather die to save me the pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.86,0:17:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never knew...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, right on the mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.84,0:17:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a sorry case!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.54,0:17:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you make friends, all you can do\Nis drag them through the mud with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:30.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't win, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.16,0:17:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at this flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.54,0:17:38.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This symbol represents the\Nunity of over 170 nations,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a power that spans the four\Nseas and the Grand Line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the world itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.52,0:17:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how loud your bark may be, you\Ncan't stand up to an enemy like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.76,0:17:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just face it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how strong\Nour organization is?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.98,0:17:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you realize how devoted\Nwe are to capturing her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.00,0:17:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's Robin's enemy,\Nthen I know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.40,0:18:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sniper King,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.94,0:18:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shoot down that flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:06.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.42,0:18:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my new weapon, a massive\Nslingshot by the name of Kavuto.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.04,0:18:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold its awesome power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Lethal Firebird Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.68,0:18:27.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mission complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now they've done it! Those idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fire on a government flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.96,0:18:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pirates just declared war\Nagainst the world government!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.18,0:18:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.16,0:18:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You morons can't challenge the\Nentire world and expect to win! Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.50,0:19:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's still something\NI want to hear you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.02,0:19:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:26.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.12,0:19:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.38,0:19:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can live.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Face it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.30,0:19:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your whole existence\Nis nothing but a crime!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:43.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world's against you, Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be allowed to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.02,0:19:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never dared to wish\Nfor something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world had denied me that hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.68,0:20:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea's a vast place, so I guarantee...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.82,0:20:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday you'll find friends\Nwho won't ever leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.96,0:20:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now, if I'm allowed to\Nsay my wish just this once,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.22,0:20:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.98,0:20:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.34,0:20:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.25,0:20:33.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.32,0:20:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me away from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys, you're so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:04.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.36,0:21:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
